    "faq": {
      "type": "mt-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is MARCEL OraShield?",
            "answer": "<p>MARCEL OraShield is a therapeutic oral rinse and a key part of MARCEL OMR Therapy Advance Kit. It is used as part of a care plan for OSMF, with guidance from a healthcare professional.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who is MARCEL OraShield intended for?",
            "answer": "<p>It is for people with Stage 3 and Stage 4 OSMF. A MARCEL OSMF Consultant can assess you and help decide which care approach is suitable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I use MARCEL OraShield?",
            "answer": "<p>It comes as a concentrate. Add 5 to 10 drops to about 160 mL of lukewarm water, gargle or rinse for 20 to 30 seconds and spit out. Do not swallow. Follow each rinse with your prescribed mouth and jaw exercises.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How frequently should I use it?",
            "answer": "<p>Use it twice daily, or as advised by your physician or MARCEL OSMF Consultant.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can MARCEL OraShield be used alone?",
            "answer": "<p>MARCEL OraShield is one part of MARCEL OMR Therapy Advance Kit. The complete routine includes:</p><ul><li>MARCEL OraShield Therapeutic Oral Rinse</li><li>MARCEL Smile Toothpaste</li><li>Prescribed mouth and jaw exercises</li><li>Follow-up with your MARCEL OSMF Consultant</li></ul><p>Following only one part may leave your care routine incomplete. We recommend following the complete routine as advised by your consultant.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does MARCEL OraShield cure OSMF?",
            "answer": "<p>A complete cure or a return to exactly the same mouth opening cannot be promised. The focus is to assess the condition, address symptoms and work toward the best achievable function for the individual. A qualified OSMF Specialist Doctor can explain the options after assessing the case.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I feel irritation or an unusual reaction?",
            "answer": "<p>Stop using the product and ask a qualified healthcare professional for advice. Follow the safety instructions on the product label.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
